The unnecessary call to `gpiochip_remove` was included in the error handling flow after attempting to add the GPIO chip with `devm_gpiochip_add_data()`. Since this function manages the GPIO chip's lifecycle automatically, calling `gpiochip_remove` is not needed and can lead to resource management issues if the function is called on error.

